<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>AutoKit guide cover — print template</title>
<!-- In-bundle artifact template: A4 portrait PDF cover for every numbered guide.
     Swap [data-field] contents per guide. Mascot appears ONLY on OpenClaw-bundle guides. -->
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,700..800&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600&family=Fragment+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#FFFEF9;--paper-edge:#EFE6CF;--ink:#2A241A;--ink-2:#4A3F2C;--ink-3:#77694C;
  --accent:#B4470E;--accent-bright:#F43F1E;--amber:#F5A300;--live:#18A957;
  --disp:"Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;--sans:"Archivo",sans-serif;--mono:"Fragment Mono",monospace;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:#E8DFC9;font-family:var(--sans);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;padding:40px}
.page{width:640px;aspect-ratio:1/1.414;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-edge);border-radius:8px;
  box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.08),0 30px 60px -20px rgba(60,45,20,.35);padding:56px 54px;color:var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.page::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-bright),var(--amber) 55%,var(--live))}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)}
.gnum{position:absolute;top:60px;right:-14px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:220px;line-height:1;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px var(--paper-edge);letter-spacing:-.05em;user-select:none}
h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:52px;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;margin:170px 0 16px;max-width:8em;position:relative}
.sub{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.6;max-width:30em;position:relative}
.rule{height:3px;background:var(--accent);width:60px;border-radius:2px;margin:26px 0}
.specs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 28px;position:relative}
.spec{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--paper-edge);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.5}
.spec b{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);font-weight:400;min-width:74px;padding-top:2px}
.foot{margin-top:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;position:relative}
.brand{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.brand i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-bright);display:inline-block}
.foot .mono{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3);text-align:right;line-height:1.8}
@media print{body{background:none;padding:0}.page{box-shadow:none;width:100%;border:0}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="top"><span>AI Agent Starter Box · Kit Nº 01</span><span data-field="edition">OpenClaw + Hermes edition</span></div>
  <div class="gnum" data-field="gnum">05</div>
  <h1 data-field="title">Gateway checklists.</h1>
  <p class="sub" data-field="promise">Telegram and Slack, wired step by step — tokens, permissions, webhooks, and every silent failure named before you hit it.</p>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <div class="specs">
    <div class="spec"><b>Time</b><span data-field="time">25 minutes, checklist-driven</span></div>
    <div class="spec"><b>Needs</b><span data-field="needs">A running agent (Guides 02–03)</span></div>
    <div class="spec"><b>Result</b><span data-field="result">Your agent answers you in chat</span></div>
    <div class="spec"><b>If stuck</b><span data-field="rescue">§7.2 — the three silent failures</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot">
    <span class="brand"><i></i>AutoKit Labs</span>
    <span class="mono" data-field="footmeta">GATEWAY-CHECKLISTS.pdf · v1.0<br>commands verified · 2026-07</span>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
